      "statement": "The agent aggregates remote job listings from six sources queried differently: RemoteOK (tag-based, re-checked on title), Getro (concurrent searches across nine VC portfolio boards), Himalayas (full query search), Remotive (cached feed, 6h TTL, not a search), Workable (two-round crawl of schema.org LD+JSON from search pages then posting pages), and Jobicy (tag-based with geo).",
