    {
      "id": "claim_ac7c231efbff4e4197fd255f7c5ddcbe",
      "statement": "The LangSmith eval posts 24 live-data queries to /askeval (not /ask) with the EVALS x-api-key, receiving {md, jobs}; a baseline of ~0.90 is treated as a range because live boards shift hourly. Four evaluators score the response: gemini_full_correctness (Gemini structured Output, full markdown, relevant/total), gemini_listing_correctness (per-listing JobOutput, relevant/len), jev_correctness (OpenRouter typesafe/jev-1.13, threshold 0.5), and laya_correctness (local laya serve /v1/systemone model multilingual, threshold 0.5). Every evaluator short-circuits to 1.0 when empty_ok is set and jobs is empty.",
